  "description": {
    "text": "Basic Energy cards with a ©2010 line and no set symbol or collection number, in the HeartGold & SoulSilver card frame but without the background art that set gave each type of its numbered Energy. Plain copies came in theme decks of the HeartGold & SoulSilver years. Crosshatch holo copies, with the Play! Pokémon logo in the bottom right corner, were Tier One rewards of the 2010-2011 Player Rewards Program.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "English Energy Card Checklist, v2.3 (an Elite Fourum member's spreadsheet, last updated 18 October 2020)",
        "url": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1gbLJ3eqF6gyawMy5VJGJxHeBxEGAI-Md/edit"
      },
      {
        "title": "Elite Fourum: Enumerating the Unnumbered Energy Types",
        "url": "https://www.elitefourum.com/t/enumerating-the-unnumbered-energy-types/23302"
      },
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Basic Fire Energy (TCG) (Wayback Machine copy, 1 September 2026)",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20260901020457/https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Fire_Energy_(TCG)"
      }
    ]
  },
